From: yuzu <yuzu23234@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] sensors: apply live gyro and magnetic calibration

Subscribe to gyro_cal and mag_cal before enabling the physical streams.
Apply sns_cal_event (1022) in sensor units using CM * (S * SF - B).
Keep factory compensation in the DSP and wait for usable dynamic
calibration before emitting measurements. Disable physical streams before
closing calibration so the firmware persists its final estimates.

--- a/data/meson.build
+++ b/data/meson.build
@@ -20,6 +20,7 @@
 
